arked unhealthy, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n\nI opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. The summary covers the failure, the rollback, the post-rollback status, and a note not to redeploy v2.3.1 until it's fixed. The root cause of the v2.3.1 failure is still unknown, so someone should investigate it and confirm checkout traffic with the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}